  "description": "The private bridge between the Host and the first-party navide.git plugin: the git.* requests the Host maps for it (capability action git.request) and the git.* events it forwards. First-party only; not a public plugin capability. Adding a message is a minor version, removing or renaming one a major. Both copies (src/shared/gitBridgeContract.json, plugins/navide-git/src/git-feature/gitBridgeContract.json) change together.",
